@startuml MessageEntityLifeHistory
left to right direction

title Message Entity Life History

state "Start" as Start <<circle>>
state "Message Created" as Created
state "Message Stored (Global)" as Stored
state "Message Cached (Room)" as Cached
state "Message Retrieved" as Retrieved
state "Message Displayed" as Displayed
state "Message Archived" as Archived
state "Message Evicted" as Evicted
state "End" as End <<circle>>

Start --> Created
Created --> Stored
Created --> Cached

Stored : "Global chat message\npersisted in database\n(AppDbContext.GlobalMessages)"
Cached : "Room chat message\nstored in memory\n(RoomChatStateService)"

Stored --> Retrieved
Cached --> Retrieved

Retrieved : "Via:\n- MessageController (HTTP)\n- MultiplayerService (WS)\n- MessageService"

Retrieved --> Displayed
Displayed : "Rendered in:\n- Global Chat component\n- Room Chat component"

Stored --> Archived
Archived : "Older messages remain\nin database but not\nactively retrieved"

Cached --> Evicted
Evicted : "When:\n- Room is closed\n- Server restarts\n- Memory pressure"

Archived --> End
Evicted --> End
Displayed --> End

note right of Created
  Triggered by:
  - SendGlobalMessageEvent (WS)
  - SendGameRoomMessageEvent (WS)
  - MessageService processing
end note

note left of Retrieved
  Retrieval paths:
  - GET /Message/global
  - GET /Message/room/{roomId}
  - WebSocket broadcasts
end note
@enduml